ent-GlovesBoxingRiggedRandomSpawner = 隨機且經過操控的拳擊手套生成器 | random rigged boxing glove spawner
    .desc = { "" }
ent-ClothingHandsGlovesCaptain = 船長手套 | captain gloves
    .desc = 一雙尊貴的藍色手套，邊緣飾有精美的金色滾邊。真時髦。 | Regal blue gloves, with a nice gold trim. Swanky.
ent-ClothingHandsGlovesHop = 防剪手套 | papercut-proof gloves
    .desc = 非常適合處理文書工作及官僚事務。 | Perfect for dealing with paperwork and matters with bureaucracy.
ent-ClothingHandsGlovesLatex = 乳膠手套 | latex gloves
    .desc = 薄型無菌乳膠手套。這是每位醫師必備的基本個人防護裝備。 | Thin sterile latex gloves. Basic PPE for any doctor.
ent-ClothingHandsGlovesNitrile = 丁腈手套 | nitrile gloves
    .desc = 高品質的丁腈手套。價格昂貴的醫療用個人防護裝備。 | High-quality nitrile gloves. Expensive medical PPE.
ent-ClothingHandsGlovesLeather = 植物學家的皮手套 | botanist's leather gloves
    .desc = 這雙皮手套能保護雙手免受花卉上的刺、倒刺、棘刺、尖刺及其他有害物體的傷害。此外，它們還相當保暖。 | These leather gloves protect against thorns, barbs, prickles, spikes and other harmful objects of floral origin. They're also quite warm.
ent-ClothingHandsGlovesPowerglove = 動力手套 | power gloves
    .desc = 現在我正在玩電力！等等……它們都關掉了。
ent-ClothingHandsGlovesRobohands = 機器人手套 | robohands gloves
    .desc = 嗶嗶噗！ | Beep boop borp!
ent-ClothingHandsGlovesSpaceNinja = 太空忍者手套 | space ninja gloves
    .desc = 這雙黑色、經奈米技術強化處理的手套具有絕緣與防火功能。 | These black nano-enhanced gloves insulate from electricity and provide fire resistance.
ent-ClothingHandsGlovesCombat = 格鬥手套 | combat gloves
    .desc = 這款戰術手套具有防火和抗衝擊的特性。 | These tactical gloves are fireproof and shock resistant.
ent-ClothingHandsTacticalMaidGloves = 戰術女僕手套 | tactical maid gloves
    .desc = 戰術女僕手套，每位自尊自愛的女僕都應該能夠悄無聲息地解決她的目標。 | Tactical maid gloves, every self-respecting maid should be able to discreetly eliminate her goals.
ent-ClothingHandsMercGlovesCombat = 傭兵戰鬥手套 | mercenary combat gloves
    .desc = 高品質的戰鬥手套，可在戰鬥中保護雙手免受機械性損傷。 | High-quality combat gloves to protect hands from mechanical damage during combat.
ent-ClothingHandsGlovesFingerless = 無指手套 | fingerless gloves
    .desc = 專為辛勤工作者設計的素面黑色無指手套。 | Plain black gloves without fingertips for the hard working.
ent-ClothingHandsGlovesFingerlessInsulated = 無指絕緣手套 | fingerless insulated gloves
    .desc = 絕緣手套具有抗衝擊性，或者說，至少以前是這樣。 | Insulated gloves resistant to shocks, or at least they used to.
ent-ClothingHandsGlovesMercFingerless = 傭兵無指手套 | mercenary fingerless gloves
    .desc = 這副手套或許無法防止手指被燙傷，但會讓你看起來更酷。 | Gloves that may not protect you from finger burns, but will make you cooler.
ent-ThievingGloves = { ent-ClothingHandsGlovesColorBlack }
    .desc = { ent-ClothingHandsGlovesColorBlack.desc }
    .suffix = Thieving
ent-ClothingHandsGlovesCluwne = 北極星手套 | cluwne hands
    .desc = 這副手套能讓你打出極其快速的拳擊。 | A cursed pair of cluwne hands.
    .suffix = Unremoveable
ent-ClothingHandsGlovesNorthStar = 鑑識手套 | gloves of the north star
    .desc = 切勿留下纖維或指紋。若你在辦案時沒有做到這一點，那你就是個「爛透了的偵探」。 | These gloves allow you to punch incredibly fast.
ent-ClothingHandsGlovesForensic = 橡膠手套 | forensic gloves
    .desc = 高品質的橡膠手套，吱吱作響，準備來打掃一下囉！ | Do not leave fibers or fingerprints. If you work without them, you're A TERRIBLE DETECTIVE.
ent-ClothingHandsGlovesJanitor = 橡膠手套 | rubber gloves
    .desc = 冷鍛塑鋼指節套，讓你的拳頭擊打時更具威力。 | High-quality rubber gloves, squeaky to do some cleaning!
ent-ClothingHandsKnuckleDusters = 指節銅環 | knuckle dusters
    .desc = 這是一款傳統製法的指節銅環，至今仍能打出同樣強勁的衝擊力。 | Cold plasteel knuckle dusters, makes your punches hit much harder.
ent-ClothingHandsKnuckleDustersBrass = 司務長的黃金指節套 | brass knuckle dusters
    .desc = 融合了塑鋼材質的24K金，並鐫刻有Nanotrasen標誌。這正是司務長威力的真正象徵。 | Brass knuckle dusters, just like how they used to make em and still hit just as hard.
ent-ClothingHandsKnuckleDustersQM = 辛迪加鐵指虎 | QM's golden knuckle dusters
    .desc = 印有血紅色「S」標誌的「Plastitanium」指節銅環。真正的男人會用這些把人打死。 | 24karat gold infused with plasteel and branded with the Nanotrasen logo. A true symbol of the Quartermaster's might.
ent-ClothingHandsKnuckleDustersSyndicate = 電擊指節套 | syndicate knuckle dusters
    .desc = 一對指節銅環，結合了電擊警棍的科技。這讓擊退潮民變得輕鬆許多。 | Plastitanium knuckle dusters branded with the blood-red S. A real man beats someone to death with these.
ent-ClothingHandsKnuckleDustersStun = 碎骨機 | stun knuckle dusters
    .desc = 受諸神賜福，將粉碎所有不遵從者。 | A pair of knuckle dusters combined with the tech of a stun baton. This makes beating tiders a whole lot easier.
ent-ClothingHandsKnuckleBoneCrushers = bone crushers
    .desc = Blessed by the Gods to break all those who don't obey.
